	"hadiths": [
		{
			"hadithnumber": 273,
			"arabicnumber": 273,
			"text": "Aishah said; The Messenger of Allah (May peace be upon him) would ask us in the beginning of our menstruation to tie the waist-wrapper. Then he would embrace us. And who amongst you can have as much control over his desire as the Messenger of Allah (May peace be upon him) had over his desire?",
